                                                "sense_id": "e274c006-2618-3430-9126-fac5d8bffbb6",
                                                "text": "[…] the Japanese Ministry of Defence rang the bell and informed the world's press about the Tokyo Express — the ironic Japanese nickname for the constant flow of Soviet flying eavesdroppers in Japanese airspace."
